WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.280
Hello, I'm Dr. Courtney Williams, owner of CJW Chiropractic Solutions in Irving, Texas.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:11.080
Doing business as MyoCore, we're a chiropractic franchise.

00:00:11.940 --> 00:00:16.180
I've been working with Fred now for about a little over a month.

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:18.400
Very impressed with it.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:22.540
Me and my business partner have tried to trip it up a lot.

00:00:22.640 --> 00:00:26.320
We work in a HIPAA-reliant field, so a lot of information can't get out.

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:32.980
We're very limited on what we can talk about on our social medias and on our pages.

00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:37.020
So it's been impressive seeing how Fred works.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:45.300
I would say the most important reason that we got it is because in today's day and age,

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:49.200
people do not want to skim through pages and pages through your webpage.

00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:54.220
So we got something that they can put up to their mouth, they can ask a question, they can get an answer,

00:00:54.220 --> 00:00:59.400
they can get directed into the appropriate lane they need to go if it's making an appointment.

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:03.300
Does it take this insurance? Does it do this and do that?

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:07.780
And Fred pretty much filled their role in every aspect.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.360
We tried to break it. It wouldn't break. It answered all the questions.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:15.500
We even went down the rabbit hole of dealing with some mental health issues,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:18.360
and it directed people in the right direction.

00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:23.380
It told people what it couldn't do, what it could do, and where they could get help from.

00:01:23.380 --> 00:01:29.700
And that pretty much surprised me because I didn't know where we were going to go once that conversation took a turn.

00:01:30.200 --> 00:01:33.300
So if you're in the market for it, I definitely recommend it.
